  "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p>List of various weapons and vehicles used by major combatants during the <a href=\"/wiki/Third_Mexican-American_War\" title=\"Third Mexican-American War\">Third Mexican War.</a>\n</p>\n<div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Armor\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Armor</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Firearms\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Firearms</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Drones\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Drones</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Aircraft\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Aircraft</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Spacecraft\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Spacecraft</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#Watercraft\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">6</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Watercraft</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-7\"><a href=\"#Missiles_and_Bombs\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">7</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Missiles and Bombs</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Armor\"><a href=\"/wiki/Armor\" title=\"Armor\">Armor</a></span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-